# Secrets. The real .env never goes into the repository.
.env

# Raw photographs from the phone: needed for developing the cropping, but they show
# number plates and people. They NEVER go into the repository.
testset/raw/

# The inner workings of development: the working agreement, the plans, the decision log.
# They are kept up and stay on disk — but do not go into the published repository.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
PLAN.md
PLAN_NEXT.md

# Added on 2026-09-18 by the developer's decision. The file stays on disk and is kept
# up, but does not go into the repository.
PROJECT_BRIEF.md

# Working files of the developer and the AI assistant: drafts and notes on direction.
PARKREAD_PLAN.md

# System
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# The test set's photographs stay on the developer's disk (decision 185, 2026-09-27):
# part of them are Street View captures that are not the developer's to publish, and
# some show number plates. What the tests and the measurement need of them - the name
# and the pixel count - lives in testset/photos.json, which IS in the repository, with
# the reference readings and the model's saved answers.
testset/photos/

# A page of the «Körkortsboken» textbook was removed from the project: the publisher
# allows short quotations with the source named, but not reproducing the page. The
# rule stays so the picture does not come back by accident. The analysis is in
# reference/sources/RULES_SOURCE.md.
rules.png

# Working notes on the official material (the regulator's texts and catalogues): kept on
# the developer's disk as the record of where the rules come from, not published.
reference/sources/

# Screenshots of the official sign catalogues were removed in the clean-up: they are
# other people's images, while the sign descriptions in reference/sources/*.md are
# textual and self-contained. The rule stays so the pictures do not come back by
# accident.
reference/sources/*.png
reference/sources/*.jpg
